                            8
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِنْتَصَفَ مِنْهُ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>He exacted,</i> or <i>obtained, his
right,</i> or <i>due, from him</i> (M, K) <i>completely, so
that each of them became on a par with the
other;</i> (K;) [i. e. <i>with equity</i>]. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِنْتَصَفَ</span>
                        <i>It
